1
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,479
Chairwoman Shen,

2
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,200
Zhao Gang is here to see you.

3
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:06,640
Where is everybody?

4
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,439
They even left the motorcycle behind.

5
00:01:11,359 --> 00:01:12,359
Could it be...

6
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,959
this is another gift for me?

7
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,000
Hey.

8
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,280
You're that Ma Dawei, aren't you?

9
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:27,079
Something you need?

10
00:01:27,319 --> 00:01:28,359
So you're the one...

11
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:30,879
who bought fourteen properties on Chengbei Old Street.

12
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,079
How much did you spend?

13
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,959
I'll add ten percent on top.

14
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:36,200
Sign the papers,

15
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:37,959
take the cash,

16
00:01:38,239 --> 00:01:40,000
and go back to selling clothes in peace.

17
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:42,959
I knew that old fox Zhao Gang...

18
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:44,480
wanted to use these peanuts...

19
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,319
to swindle me out of my trump card.

20
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,040
In his dreams.

21
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,159
I'm not signing.

22
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,480
Go back and tell Mr. Zhao...

23
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,239
if he thinks this chump change will cut me off,

24
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,159
it's not enough.

25
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:56,760
You know Mr. Zhao?

26
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,519
Well, Mr. Zhao doesn't know you.

27
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:04,239
Ma Dawei,

28
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,879
Mr. Zhao is doing you a favor by offering extra.

29
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,599
Don't be ungrateful.

30
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,919
Mr. Zhao is in such a rush...

31
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:13,000
to buy up these crumbling ruins.

32
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:14,960
Could it be...

33
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,039
this place is slated for demolition?

34
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:17,840
You...

35
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:24,159
You don't really think money falls from the sky, do you?

36
00:02:24,479 --> 00:02:25,919
Don't push your luck.

37
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,719
Mr. Zhao doesn't want bloodshed today.

38
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:30,240
You'd better cough up those properties.

39
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:32,479
If you want to do it the hard way,

40
00:02:32,479 --> 00:02:32,879
watch your back...

41
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,039
Lay a finger on me, I dare you.

42
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,719
Doing business...

43
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,439
requires mutual consent.

44
00:02:42,319 --> 00:02:43,000
What,

45
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,680
does Zhao Gang want to force a buyout?

46
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,199
Since there's nothing else,

47
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,479
get out of my way.

48
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,759
This kid's so cocky.

49
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,280
What's his background?

50
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:11,840
Chairwoman Shen,

51
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,599
you're back.

52
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:19,960
Your outfit looks so classy.

53
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:24,719
By the way,

54
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,479
I specifically asked someone

55
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:28,599
to get this Da Hong Pao tea from Mount Wuyi.

56
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,439
Have a taste.

57
00:03:31,039 --> 00:03:31,639
Brew some.

58
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,120
Chairwoman Shen.

59
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,759
As for the Chengbei demolition site,

60
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:51,439
leaving it to Zhao's Construction

61
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,599
will give you total peace of mind.

62
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,520
President Zhao,

63
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:57,120
regarding the Chengbei project,

64
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,599
I want things to go smoothly

65
00:03:58,599 --> 00:03:59,319
and stay clean.

66
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,599
Rest assured.

67
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,120
I, Zhao Gang,

68
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:04,039
am a legitimate businessman now.

69
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:05,280
All my men

70
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:06,960
play strictly by the book.

71
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,840
They're completely civilized,

72
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,560
and entirely reasonable.

73
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,159
The reason I came today

74
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,040
is just to let you know

75
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,759
that Zhao's Construction

76
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,600
wants to offer you a ten percent stake.

77
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,480
Please accept it.

78
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,360
President Zhao,

79
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,680
there's no need to be nervous.

80
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:33,279
You should know full well

81
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,240
that Cloud Summit

82
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,920
has already given you several projects.

83
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,879
Since I, Shen Jialing,

84
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:39,079
have decided to give the Chengbei demolition to you,

85
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:40,720
I will definitely keep my word.

86
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,040
So you don't need to bribe me like this.

87
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:45,720
However,

88
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:49,160
Chengbei is Cloud Summit's top priority.

89
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:50,199
If I find out

90
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,920
that anyone is causing trouble there,

91
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,439
then I, Shen Jialing,

92
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:56,120
will make sure they can't survive in Nancheng.

93
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,040
Yes, of course.

94
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:01,720
Chairwoman Shen,

95
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,199
rest assured.

96
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:06,480
If anyone dares resort to violence in Chengbei,

97
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,399
I, Zhao Gang,

98
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,959
will be the first to take them out!

99
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:21,759
Mom!

100
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:22,759
All right, all right.

101
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,399
So, what's the deal, Old Ma?

102
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:30,399
The 100,000 in compensation you promised Qianqian...

103
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,040
It's been so long.

104
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:32,759
Where's the money?

105
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:33,279
Dad.

106
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,120
Mrs. Liu...

107
00:05:36,519 --> 00:05:37,639
about the money...

108
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,240
could you give us a few more days?

109
00:05:39,839 --> 00:05:40,879
It's a lot of money, after all.

110
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:42,160
Even if you want me to conjure it up,

111
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:42,839
I can't just pull it

112
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,240
out of thin air, right?

113
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,079
Liu Meilan,

114
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,600
don't push us too far!

115
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,519
Let me tell you,

116
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,600
this 100,000 yuan...

117
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,240
to put it bluntly, you're extorting us!

118
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,600
That's illegal, you know?

119
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,360
Either way, we just don't have the money!

120
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,560
Even if you keep pushing us,

121
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,480
we still don't have it!

122
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:56,519
No money?

123
00:05:56,879 --> 00:05:59,160
Then pay with something else!

124
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,639
What a disaster!

125
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,560
Your house is a bit run-down,

126
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,759
but it's barely livable.

127
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,160
How about this?

128
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:16,120
Sign the deed over to our Qianqian,

129
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:18,600
and we'll call that 100,000 settled.

130
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,839
Out of the goodness of my heart,

131
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,879
I'll let you off cheap.

132
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:23,959
In your dreams!

133
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,639
If we give it to you, we'll be out on the street!

134
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,839
That's out of the question!

135
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,360
This is our ancestral home!

136
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:29,160
You...

137
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,199
Liu Meilan,

138
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:32,959
you've really got it all figured out, haven't you!

139
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:40,560
Dawei!

140
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,240
When did you get back?

141
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:45,240
Where did this motorcycle come from?

142
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,360
Look at the Ma family.

143
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,199
They have money for a motorcycle, but none to pay their debts!

144
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,600
How ridiculous is that?

145
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,480
Dad,

146
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,360
have a seat.

147
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,160
Auntie Liu,

148
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:58,560
this 100,000 breakup fee...

149
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,600
isn't yours to decide.

150
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:00,600
Ma Dawei!

151
00:07:01,079 --> 00:07:04,000
Dating our Qianqian was way out of your league!

152
00:07:04,279 --> 00:07:05,560
Asking you for 100,000 today

153
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,920
is already going easy on you!

154
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,079
If you ask me,

155
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:09,240
in this lifetime,

156
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,639
you won't even be able to afford a wife!

157
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,519
Dad...

158
00:07:15,079 --> 00:07:16,160
With the oldest Ma son dead,

159
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,120
they can't even pay back that 200,000 debt.

160
00:07:18,879 --> 00:07:20,480
They'll never get back on their feet.

161
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,800
They owe that much?

162
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,360
Yeah.

163
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,879
Hello, Mr. Zhao?

164
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,199
What?!

165
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:34,560
Ma Dawei bought 14 properties?

166
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:35,759
Fourteen?!

167
00:07:37,759 --> 00:07:38,120
This...

168
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,040
It's fine.

169
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,079
Dad.

170
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,319
Fourteen properties?

171
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:43,800
How is that possible?

172
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,519
Yes, Mr. Zhao!

173
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,439
He was just keeping a low profile.

174
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,680
Could there be some mistake?

175
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:49,720
Ma... Ma Dawei?

176
00:07:50,439 --> 00:07:51,879
Where would he get the money for houses?

177
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,120
Mistake, my ass!

178
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,360
I don't care what you have to do,

179
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:56,959
you get those 14 properties back

180
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:57,879
today!

181
00:07:58,319 --> 00:07:59,399
If you can't pull this off,

182
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,120
don't bother coming to work tomorrow!

183
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:04,199
What happened?

184
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,079
The boss lost his temper?

185
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:09,160
Holy cow!

186
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,839
Fourteen whole properties!

187
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,360
This time,

188
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,920
Zhou Qian's going to regret dumping Dawei!

189
00:08:15,319 --> 00:08:17,759
Wonder who's out of whose league now!
